{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MIMICRY is a chaotic multiplayer <strong>hide-and-seek</strong> game inspired by games like <strong>Gmod Prop Hunt</strong> and <strong>Witch It</strong>, where a bunch of cute lil' Mimics have escaped their laboratory containment to cause mischief and mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With up to 12 of your friends, play as either:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Exterminators:</strong>\u00a0Mysterious figures clad in bright yellow HAZMAT suits. Use a deadly array of <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong>gadgets</strong> to locate and hunt down the rogue Mimics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mimics:</strong>\u00a0Shapeshifting creatures that can <strong>transform</strong> into any object in the room to hide in plain sight, while they must <strong>consume</strong> other objects to sate their enormous appetite!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a player dies as a Mimic, they join the Exterminator team, so you're always a part of the action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the Exterminators restore order to the lab by eradicating the Mimics, or will the Mimics survive long enough to wreak havoc?<br><strong><u></u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disguise as Props</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/2db54caeca5b9f7ede4babcba851e82a.poster.avif?t=1761867331\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/2db54caeca5b9f7ede4babcba851e82a.webm?t=1761867331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/2db54caeca5b9f7ede4babcba851e82a.mp4?t=1761867331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Mimics must survive by blending in with their environment, turning into objects and orienting themselves into an inconspicuous location.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Eat to Stay Alive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/181275badc8140cb38b52da96e746c3a.poster.avif?t=1761867331\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/181275badc8140cb38b52da96e746c3a.webm?t=1761867331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/181275badc8140cb38b52da96e746c3a.mp4?t=1761867331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>However, Mimics can't just sit still the whole game! Over time, they will slowly start to get hungry, rumbling their stomach and alerting the Exterminators if they don't keep their bellies full. Fortunately, they can eat the objects around them by shooting out a small tendril to consume the prop and regain some hunger. Just make sure no-one's watching first!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Abilities to Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/267a65efd30f7911271e7260a5ceab62.poster.avif?t=1761867331\" width=800 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/267a65efd30f7911271e7260a5ceab62.webm?t=1761867331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/267a65efd30f7911271e7260a5ceab62.mp4?t=1761867331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>If you are discovered as a Mimic, you can revert into your natural form and use abilities like the Dash to escape, and perhaps run to a nearby Vent that you can slip through. These abilities do cost Hunger though, so don't be using them too often!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt with Deadly Weapons and Useful Tools</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/061019e48c52bfd5f65eb3cdde545e60.poster.avif?t=1761867331\" width=800 height=552 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/061019e48c52bfd5f65eb3cdde545e60.webm?t=1761867331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/061019e48c52bfd5f65eb3cdde545e60.mp4?t=1761867331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>As an Exterminator, use flamethrowers, grenade launchers and a whole arsenal of dangerous weapons to search rooms and flush out any fake furniture hiding there! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/5792eba359fdd54510240e5d053cd1a3.poster.avif?t=1761867331\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/5792eba359fdd54510240e5d053cd1a3.webm?t=1761867331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/5792eba359fdd54510240e5d053cd1a3.mp4?t=1761867331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Exterminators also have access to powerful tools, like the Mimic Finder, which can tell them whether or not a Mimic is in the same room with them to help narrow down their search.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 12 players in one lobby!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different maps to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 15 different Passive and Active Mimic Abilities to mix-and-match with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 8 Exterminator Weapons and Tools to pick your Loadout from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetic Customizations for the Exterminator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity Voice Chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xbox controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bucketload of chaos and whimsy!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4137450?t=1761867331","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/89f6cc9c766f3a86f31b1bf883afb631b0d0f347/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761867331","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/02bd9329a0627386882c60cd70fc660e131f74aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761867331","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/02bd9329a0627386882c60cd70fc660e131f74aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761867331","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MIMICRY is a chaotic multiplayer <strong>hide-and-seek</strong> game inspired by games like <strong>Gmod Prop Hunt</strong> and <strong>Witch It</strong>, where a bunch of cute lil' Mimics have escaped their laboratory containment to cause mischief and mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With up to 12 of your friends, 