oster.avif?t=1761867331\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/181275badc8140cb38b52da96e746c3a.webm?t=1761867331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/181275badc8140cb38b52da96e746c3a.mp4?t=1761867331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>However, Mimics can't just sit still the whole game! Over time, they will slowly start to get hungry, rumbling their stomach and alerting the Exterminators if they don't keep their bellies full. Fortunately, they can eat the objects around them by shooting out a small tendril to consume the prop and regain some hunger. Just make sure no-one's watching first!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Abilities to Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/267a65efd30f7911271e7260a5ceab62.poster.avif?t=1761867331\" width=800 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/267a65efd30f7911271e7260a5ceab62.webm?t=1761867331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/267a65efd30f7911271e7260a5ceab62.mp4?t=1761867331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>If you are discovered as a Mimic, you can revert into your natural form and use abilities like the Dash to escape, and perhaps run to a nearby Vent that you can slip through. These abilities do cost Hunger though, so don't be using them too often!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt with Deadly Weapons and Useful Tools</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137450/extras/061019e48